{"page":338,"verses":[{"verse_key":"22:47","surah":22,"ayah":47,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَسْتَعْجِلُونَكَ بِٱلْعَذَابِ وَلَن يُخْلِفَ ٱللَّهُ وَعْدَهُۥ ۚ وَإِنَّ يَوْمًا عِندَ رَبِّكَ كَأَلْفِ سَنَةٍ مِّمَّا تَعُدُّونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They will challenge you [Prophet] to hasten the punishment. God will not fail in His promise- a Day with your Lord is like a thousand years by your reckoning.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَسْتَعْجِلُونَكَ","en_gloss":"And they ask you to hasten","transliteration":"wayastaʿjilūnaka","verse_key":"22:47"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِٱلْعَذَابِ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"bil-ʿadhābi","verse_key":"22:47"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَلَن","en_gloss":"But never will","transliteration":"walan","verse_key":"22:47"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُخْلِفَ","en_gloss":"fail/violate","transliteration":"yukh'lifa","verse_key":"22:47"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"22:47"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَعْدَهُۥ ۚ","en_gloss":"(in) His Promise","transliteration":"waʿdahu","verse_key":"22:47"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"22:47"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَوْمًا","en_gloss":"a day","transliteration":"yawman","verse_key":"22:47"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"22:47"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَبِّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbika","verse_key":"22:47"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَأَلْفِ","en_gloss":"(is) like a thousand","transliteration":"ka-alfi","verse_key":"22:47"},{"pos":12,"ar":"سَنَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"year(s)","transliteration":"sanatin","verse_key":"22:47"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِّمَّا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"22:47"},{"pos":14,"ar":"تَعُدُّونَ","en_gloss":"you count","transliteration":"taʿuddūna","verse_key":"22:47"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٤٧","en_gloss":"(47)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:47"}]},{"verse_key":"22:48","surah":22,"ayah":48,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَأَيِّن مِّن قَرْيَةٍ أَمْلَيْتُ لَهَ